<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<style>
  body { font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif; background-color: #f9efe3; color: #333; margin: 0; padding: 20px; }
  .container { max-width: 900px; margin: auto; }
  .header { text-align: center; color: #90c1e1; }
  
  .grid { display: flex; gap: 20px; margin-top: 20px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .card { 
    background: white; 
    border-radius: 15px; 
    padding: 20px; 
    flex: 1; 
    min-width: 250px; 
    box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
    border: 2px solid #90c1e1;
  }
  .price { font-size: 1.5em; color: #90c1e1; font-weight: bold; }
  .btn { 
    background-color: #90c1e1; 
    color: white; 
    border: none; 
    padding: 10px 20px; 
    border-radius: 5px; 
    cursor: pointer; 
    width: 100%;
    margin-top: 10px;
  }
  .how-it-works { background-color: #90c1e1; color: white; padding: 30px; border-radius: 15px; margin-top: 40px; }
  .step-num { font-weight: bold; font-size: 1.2em; text-decoration: underline; }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="container">
  <div class="header">
    <h1>PAWSONA</h1>
    <p><i>The Future of Personalized Pet Nutrition</i></p>
  </div>

  <div class="grid">
    <div class="card">
      <h3>Custom Medical Pills</h3>
      <p>Medicine made delicious. Tailored to your pet's specific medical needs.</p>
      <p class="price">$50.00</p>
      <button class="btn">Customize Now</button>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <h3>Custom Daily Treats</h3>
      <p>Vitamin-infused treats with your pet's favorite flavors.</p>
      <p class="price">$30.00</p>
      <button class="btn">Customize Now</button>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <h3>Custom Pet Jar</h3>
      <p>Airtight, stylish, and personalized with your pet's name.</p>
      <p class="price">$15.00</p>
      <button class="btn">Customize Now</button>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="how-it-works">
    <h2>How It Works</h2>
    <p><span class="step-num">Step 1: Choose Product.</span> Medicine pill or daily treat? Tell us about your dog or horse.</p>
    <p><span class="step-num">Step 2: Customize.</span> Select flavors (Beef, Salmon) and health needs (Joints, Anxiety, etc.).</p>
    <p><span class="step-num">Step 3: Personalize.</span> We use our 3D technology to craft treats unique to your pet's size and weight.</p>
  </div>
</div>

</body>
</html>